  · unfold b65x_down
    rw [b65x_certND_ratio_1_1, b65x_crossU_eval_1_1, b65x_crossV_eval_1_1]
    exact b65x_phi_homogeneous _ _ h0 h1 h2
  · rw [b65x_crossV_eval_1_1]
